Aerie-Purpose: Put the Theme and Mode rows in the Sidebar section of Settings, and hand the page the preview swatch of every theme.
Aerie-Upstream-Area: chrome/browser/resources/settings (appearance_page/appearance_layout_page.ts, appearance_page/appearance_layout_page.html.ts, BUILD.gn), chrome/browser/ui/webui/settings (settings_localized_strings_provider.cc, BUILD.gn)
Aerie-Kind: hook

Issue #185. The row, settings-aerie-appearance-row, is a Lit element in the overlay
(chrome/browser/resources/settings/appearance_page/aerie_appearance_row.*): a radio group on
aerie.appearance.theme (six themes, a swatch each) and a horizontal radio group on
aerie.appearance.mode. The swatch colours come from aerie_appearance_settings::AddThemeSwatches
(overlay, chrome/browser/ui/webui/aerie_appearance_settings), made from the Design Tokens. The
strings are in the overlay aerie_sidebar_strings.grdp.

